{"overview":"یک دلقک ماهی به نام مارلین، در مورد پسرش نیمو زیادی حساس است. او پسرش را در اقیانوس گم می‌کند و در پی آن با کمک ماهی به نام دوری به جستجوی نیمو می‌پردازد. به تدریج و پس از یافتن نمو او متوجه می‌شود که نباید آنقدر مته به خشخاش بگذارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Nemo, an adventurous young clownfish, is unexpectedly taken from his Great Barrier Reef home to a dentist's office aquarium. It's up to his worrisome father Marlin and a friendly but forgetful fish Dory to bring Nemo home -- meeting vegetarian sharks, surfer dude turtles, hypnotic jellyfish, hungry seagulls, and more along the way.","tagline_en":"There are 3.7 trillion fish in the ocean. They're looking for one.","runtime":100,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Andrew Stanton"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"آلبرت بروکس","role":"Marlin (voice)","photo":"/8iDSGu5l93N7benjf6b3AysBore.jpg","en":"Albert Brooks"},{"name":"الن دی‌جنرس","role":"Dory (voice)","photo":"/z8IEEid4z63CBlJtxrTKEfsW7NA.jpg","en":"Ellen DeGeneres"},{"name":"Alexander Gould","role":"Nemo (voice)","photo":"/zzfj8LHhSiRntnyThvOBirEEmII.jpg"},{"name":"ویلم دفو","role":"Gill (voice)","photo":"/ui8e4sgZAwMPi3hzEO53jyBJF9B.jpg","en":"Willem Dafoe"},{"name":"جفری راش","role":"Nigel (voice)","photo":"/npXFjaFQzBNroCEPllGPTZ5IisA.jpg","en":"Geoffrey Rush"},{"name":"براد گرت","role":"Bloat (voice)","photo":"/813ffbpoaoaJRdoe1yrbivboWKp.jpg","en":"Brad Garrett"},{"name":"آلیسون جنی","role":"Peach (voice)","photo":"/kSaSnQ9xU8eVNL0mTppab95dZA8.jpg","en":"Allison Janney"},{"name":"Austin Pendleton","role":"Gurgle (voice)","photo":"/nrXfqtXDDYzSFNLPQnfLkus4I7s.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Root","role":"Bubbles (voice)","photo":"/2Zwi6AydqQQ9InVdhjYcfJXNzkp.jpg"},{"name":"Vicki Lewis","role":"Deb / Flo (voice)","photo":"/dwTjtleLh1uu8n9AvUCv0n3mi2R.jpg"},{"name":"Joe Ranft","role":"Jacques (voice)","photo":"/f1BoWC2JbCcfP1e5hKfGsxkHzVU.jpg"},{"name":"Andrew Stanton","role":"Crush (voice)","photo":"/fo6ePCWEV